<div class="page-hero" style="background:var(--color-bg-green);padding:80px 0 48px;text-align:center;">
  <div class="container">
    <span style="font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-primary);display:block;margin-bottom:12px;">Our Story</span>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);color:var(--color-primary-dark);">Born from Nature.<br>Built for Your Skin.</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container" style="max-width:860px;padding:64px 24px;">

  <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.9;color:#555;margin-bottom:24px;">
    Petal & Pine began with a single question that kept us up at night: <em>Why do so many skincare products contain ingredients we can't pronounce — and don't need?</em>
  </p>
  <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.9;color:#555;margin-bottom:24px;">
    We believed there was a better way. A cleaner way. A way that honoured both the wisdom of nature and the precision of modern science. So we set out to build it.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.9;color:#555;margin-bottom:48px;">
    Every product in our collection is the result of careful research, honest formulation, and a genuine commitment to your skin's health. We source the finest botanical ingredients from around the world — from Korean PDRN technology to Australian tea tree oil — and never compromise on purity.
  </p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);margin:0 0 48px;">

  <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:2rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);margin-bottom:32px;text-align:center;">What We Stand For</h2>

  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:56px;">
    <div style="background:var(--color-bg-green);border-radius:12px;padding:28px;">
      <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🌿</div>
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">100% Natural & Botanical</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:#666;line-height:1.7;margin:0;">Every formula is built around plant-powered actives — flowers, roots, seeds, and marine botanicals chosen for their proven skin benefits.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--color-bg-green);border-radius:12px;padding:28px;">
      <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🐰</div>
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">Cruelty-Free & Vegan</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:#666;line-height:1.7;margin:0;">We never test on animals. Our formulas contain no animal-derived ingredients. Beauty should never come at the cost of another life.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--color-bg-green);border-radius:12px;padding:28px;">
      <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🔬</div>
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">Science-Backed Formulas</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:#666;line-height:1.7;margin:0;">From PDRN technology to micro-active botanicals, we pair the best of nature with cutting-edge cosmetic science for real, visible results.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--color-bg-green);border-radius:12px;padding:28px;">
      <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">♻️</div>
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);margin-bottom:8px;">Clean & Transparent</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:#666;line-height:1.7;margin:0;">No hidden ingredients. No greenwashing. We publish every ingredient in every formula and stand behind every claim we make.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);margin:0 0 48px;">

  <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:2rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);margin-bottom:20px;">The Name</h2>
  <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.9;color:#555;margin-bottom:48px;">
    <strong>Petal</strong> represents the delicate, gentle side of our formulas — soothing, nourishing, and kind to even the most sensitive skin. <strong>Pine</strong> represents strength, resilience, and the grounded power of nature. Together, they are who we are: gentle enough to care, strong enough to deliver results.
  </p>

  <div style="background:var(--color-primary-dark);border-radius:16px;padding:48px 40px;text-align:center;color:white;">
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.625rem;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.5;">"We don't just want you to have better skin.<br>We want you to feel better about what you put on it."</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.875rem;opacity:0.65;margin:0;">— The Petal & Pine Team</p>
  </div>

</div>

